					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Function" "First ESD stage on the 50-ohm port node at the J300 pad (rule R35: pad, then TVS, then GND via within 0.5 mm; via 0.44 mm away).\n- Capacitance 0.15 pF typ / 0.19 pF max.\n- 5 V standoff: it never conducts at +20 dBm (3.16 Vpk).\n- Two-stage with D1: D300's turn-on overshoot couples through R302's 0.02-0.05 pF into RFIN (1.9-4.5 V per 100 V), so D1 conducts during port ESD.\n- Ref is D300 because D12 exists on External_ADC.kicad_sch.\n- Reuses D1's verified DSN0603-2 land."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "52065ced-5c7c-4c3b-a53c-00a61cd0f911")
			(effects
