		(property "Function" "Calibration input for the shield jumper W1 (U.FL plug). +20 dBm CW max, termination-limited (RF-05): at +20 dBm R300/R301 dissipate 50 mW each of their 100 mW rating, +23 dBm would be 100 %; never exceed. Placed 6.50 mm east of J1, same orientation; F.SilkS 'CAL' (and 'AIMD' at J1) are on the board. Rated 30 mating cycles; firmware logs the mate count. Ref is J300, not J8: J8 is the touch-panel connector (TE 84953-6) in the adopted display plan."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
