		(property "Function" "Feed-through filter into the RF/AFE area: +5V_A enters here and leaves as +5V_RF (U2 VPOS, C1, C3, C5-C8, C901, U1). S21 about -59 to -68 dB at 64/128 MHz. Rev A has no shield can; place it on the east wall of the AFE GND ring (P1-17 / D16, checkpoint 4) with both GND pads straight into ring copper, at least 2 GND vias per GND pad."
