		(property "Function" "Holds U2 ENBL low while +5V_RF (VDD pin 3, fed from +5V_A through FL1) is below the TLV809EA46 threshold or its startup delay is active. Kept (S-1 rejected by the lead): ADL5511 Rev E Table 3 p.8 allows ENBL tied to VPOS only if the supply ramp is < 20 ms, and the LT3045 +5V_A rail ramps in about 55 ms (CSET 470 nF, fast start-up unused). Sense the local rail with C1 beside the supply and ground pins."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
