		(property "Function" "Provides feedforward (CFF 22 pF) across the upper buck feedback resistor R16. With RFBT 23.2k the zero sits at 312 kHz (218 kHz with the former 33.2k); SNVSBY5B Eq. 9 (CFF < COUT x sqrt(VOUT) / 1.2 MOhm) allows about 33-40 pF with the DC-bias-derated C39 + C42 (2 x 22 uF), so 22 pF keeps margin (P1-23 keeps C41). Place beside R16 and U6 FB pin 8, with the feedback node kept away from SW copper."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "2d91f0fc-10d4-4822-9d1c-3bf8f419c4f0")
