		(property "Function" "Samples envelope and reference voltages, captures trigger times, and manages SD recording and the screen. Keep ADC/reference pins beside their filters and fast digital routes over continuous ground. PB1 = TIM1_CH3N (AF1) BUCK_SYNC. HSE = 12 MHz bypass (Y1). VCAP1 (pin 48) tied to VCAP2 (pin 73) per AN4938. PE3 (pin 2) / PE4 (pin 3) read RECORD_N_MCU / MARK_N_MCU behind the 1k R46 / R47 (SC-11), with the internal GPIO pull-ups (PUPDR = 01, RPU 30-50k; R44/R49 removed, FEAT-5). NRST (pin 14): internal permanent pull-up + C46 only (R18 and reset button SW3 removed, FEAT-4/5); reset via SWD SYSRESETREQ, J6.3 or IWDG. PA1 (pin 23, ex-LCD_TE, FEAT-6), PB3 (pin 89, ex-SWO, S-18) and PD3 (pin 84, ex-LID_INT, S-24) are not connected: firmware sets them analog; trace output uses RTT over SWD or USB CDC. Display wake is by RECORD/MARK press or VBUS attach (OPT3004 U702 removed, DIS-1; I2C1 address 0x45 reserved). PC2_C (pin 17) reads EXP_VHP_SNS: EXP_VHP = V(pin) x 6.000 (R412 100k / R413 20k, PAS-04). BOOT0 (pin 94): R20 pull-down only (S-16, SW4/R801 removed); DFU entry is the firmware boot stub, bench recovery straps R20 pad 1 to +3V3_D."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "ee25b95f-05c8-4fe1-9056-bf3f10f3c678")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
