		(property "Function" "Blocks DC while coupling the attenuated RF signal into U2. Place inline between R2 and the D1/U2 input node, without an RF probe stub. J1-path HPF corner about 1 MHz (RF-M2); J1 gain -0.97/-0.94 % at 63.86/127.74 MHz, removed by the per-frequency calibration; C2 is outside the CAL_IN path."
