		(property "Function" "Forms the upper buck feedback resistor (RFBT), sensing +3V3_D after L1. P1-23/D24: 23.2k/10k gives VOUT = 1.00 V x (1 + 23.2/10) = 3.320 V (3.24-3.40 V with VFB 0.99-1.01 V and 1 % resistors) and RFBT||RFBB = 6.99 kOhm (6.92-7.06 kOhm), mid-window of the 5-10 kOhm feedback-detect range (SNVSBY5B 9.2.2.2.1 Eq. 5 (was SNVSBE0H 8.2.2.2.1 Eq.5; Eq.6 RFBT <= 33.2 kOhm met). Place beside U6 FB pin 8 and sense the output-capacitor node away from SW copper."
