		(property "Function" "SC-11: 1k in series between the SW2 button line (MARK_N) and the C70/U8 pin 3 node (MARK_N_MCU, pulled up by the PE4 internal pull-up; R49 removed, FEAT-5). Limits the C70 discharge on a press to 3.3 mA and damps the long button trace with C70 (low-pass); pressed level 3.3 V x 1k/41k = 0.08 V (40k typ internal pull-up), below VIL 0.3 x VDD. B side at the U8 end of the line."
