		(property "Function" "Sets U10's display-branch current limit: 100k 0.1 % gives IOS 234 / 266 / 303 mA min / nom / max (SLVSDL7 9.5.1 Eq.1, valid 15k-232k); the +3V3_UI load is logic only (panel and touch IDD <= 38 mA; the backlight runs from VSYS via Q201). Place directly between ILIM pin 5 and local ground, clear of output-current and clock routes. Keep the 0603 land (an 0402 pad 2 would short to the UI_FAULT_N via)."
