		(property "Function" "microSD EMI filter + ESD at J3 (S-19a, replaces R27-R38, D4-D10, C911): 45R series + pi filter (Cline <= 20 pF) on CLK/CMD/DAT0-3, 90k pull-ups on CMD/DAT0-2 and WP/CD, DAT3 pull-up via RDATA_VCC tied to VCC (ST Fig. 2/9), 470k DAT3 pull-down unused (RDAT3_GND NC), 8 kV contact ESD on the Ex pins. Place on B under J3's contacts, Ex row facing J3. Firmware: SDMMC1 GPIO speed medium (no MCU-side source resistor)."
