		(property "Function" "Filters RECORD_N_MCU (U8 pin 2) contact bounce and coupled noise with the PE3 internal pull-up (R44 removed, FEAT-5; 40k x 100 nF = 4 ms release); the 1k R46 limits its discharge on a press and forms a low-pass with it. Place near U8 pin 2 with a short ground return; firmware still debounces the button and arms it >= 30 ms after enabling the pull-up."
