	(gr_text "FAB NOTES - RFVD SENSOR-D REV A\n1. 6 LAYERS, JLC06161H-3313 IMPEDANCE STACKUP, 1.6 MM FINISHED\n2. COPPER: OUTER 1 OZ (35 UM), INNER 0.5 OZ (15.2 UM)\n3. LAYERS: F / IN1 GND / IN2 GND / IN3 SIGNAL / IN4 GND / B\n4. ALL VIAS IPC-4761 TYPE VII: RESIN FILLED AND COPPER CAPPED (POFV)\n5. FINISH ENIG; GREEN SOLDER MASK; WHITE SILKSCREEN\n6. MIN TRACK / SPACE 0.10 / 0.10 MM; MIN VIA 0.45 / 0.20 MM\n7. IMPEDANCE: NET CLASS RF_50R, 0.15 MM ON F.CU OVER IN1 GND = 50 OHM"
